    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Bone Knight Dedication</p><hr /><p>You bind the skeletal remnants of a loyal war beast into your personal ivory mount, animated with Karrnathi necromantic craft. You gain an animal companion that serves as your loyal mount (typically a horse, wolf, or riding monitor). Your mount gains the undead trait: it is healed by void effects, harmed by vitality effects, and is immune to bleed, death effects, disease, paralyzed, poison, and unconscious conditions. It does not require food, drink, air, or sleep.</p>"
